@startuml provider-health-states
title Provider health (ADR-022 section 2, CP3d)

skinparam stateBorderColor #555555
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

state "unknown\n(no health record)" as Unknown
state HEALTHY
state DEGRADED
state UNAVAILABLE
state RECOVERING

[*] --> Unknown
Unknown --> HEALTHY : true first deployment:\nfirst valid adsb.fi response
Unknown --> RECOVERING : success
Unknown --> UNAVAILABLE : failure

HEALTHY --> DEGRADED : failure
HEALTHY --> UNAVAILABLE : OpenSky 429 with a retry time,\nfrom any state (sets paused_until_ms)
DEGRADED --> HEALTHY : success
DEGRADED --> DEGRADED : failure\n(60 s clock unchanged)
DEGRADED --> UNAVAILABLE : deadline timer, 60 s after entry\n(stamped at the deadline)
UNAVAILABLE --> RECOVERING : first success
RECOVERING --> HEALTHY : success once 120 s of\nevery request succeeding
RECOVERING --> UNAVAILABLE : any failure\n(streak cleared)

note bottom of UNAVAILABLE
  Authority is NOT changed in CP3d.
  adsb.fi stays authoritative and keeps
  polling and publishing while UNAVAILABLE.
end note

note right of HEALTHY
  Restore at lease acquisition:
  HEALTHY, DEGRADED -> DEGRADED (fresh 60 s)
  RECOVERING -> UNAVAILABLE (streak cleared)
  UNAVAILABLE -> UNAVAILABLE
  future pause kept, expired pause cleared
end note
@enduml
